    "chunk_size_bytes": 1021,
    "chunk_text": "There\u2019s a second kind of cost hiding in the same blind spot: a fraud case or a data leak with no evidence trail to answer it. 10 years ago, that was rare. Today, it\u2019s common and expensive when it happens. Paying a little every month to stay covered against a rare, expensive hit isn\u2019t a cost, it\u2019s an investment. It\u2019s no different from vehicle insurance: accidents are expensive, so a monthly or annual premium is paid to provide cover if and when one happens.\n\nThe working world moved to hybrid and remote, permanently. The risks that come with not seeing that world clearly\u2014cost, fraud, compliance\u2014are real, not hypothetical. And the standard that governs it needs to hold up anywhere in the world. That\u2019s the case for HR Optimizer: not a tool that watches people, but the governance layer that lets a business run with confidence in the way work actually happens now.\n\nFiNAC HR Optimizer is a product of Datamation Systems Ltd., a software company operating since 1986, with over 400 satisfied clients."
