    "md5": "93dc3f39f1027b0d60ef397cc569926f",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1757,
    "chunk_text": "Sathosa Motors achieves ISO 9001:2015 Certification\n\nSathosa Motors PLC (SML), the authorized distributor for Isuzu vehicles in Sri Lanka, has achieved ISO 9001:2015 certification, marking an important milestone in the company\u2019s continued commitment to quality management, customer satisfaction and operational excellence.\n\nThe certification has been awarded by Bureau Veritas Certification Holding SAS \u2013 UK Branch, following an audit of Sathosa Motors PLC\u2019s management system. The certification confirms that the company\u2019s management system has been audited and found to comply with the requirements of the internationally recognized ISO 9001:2015 Quality Management System standard.\n\nThe scope of the certification covers the import and sales of Isuzu brand-new vehicles, sales of Isuzu Genuine Spare Parts, and after-sales services including repair and maintenance.\n\nThis achievement reflects Sathosa Motors PLC\u2019s commitment to maintaining structured and consistent processes throughout the customer journey\u2014from the purchase of a new Isuzu vehicle to the supply of genuine spare parts and the provision of professional repair and maintenance services.\n\nMore importantly, the certification reinforces SML\u2019s focus on continuously strengthening its systems to deliver dependable products and services while meeting the evolving expectations of customers.\n\nThe ISO 9001:2015 accreditation is a multi-site certification, extending beyond the company\u2019s Head Office in Colombo. It encompasses key operations within the SML network, including the Peliyagoda, Vauxhall Street and Kurunegala workshops, together with genuine spare-parts operations at branches in Rathnapura, Badulla, Dambulla, Kandy, Panchikawatta, Matara, Kurunegala and Negombo."
