    "date_str": "2026-09-15",
    "description": "Beyond judicial tenure: Retaining experience while reforming the justice system",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.ft.lk/columns/Beyond-judicial-tenure-Retaining-experience-while-reforming-the-justice-system/4-797234",
