    "description": "BRICS: While others lobbied,Sri Lanka lost ground",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/breaking-news/BRICS-While-others-lobbied-Sri-Lanka-lost-ground/108-350314",
    "lang": "en",
    "newspaper_id": "dailymirrorlk",
