    "date_str": "2026-09-15",
    "description": "EY urges IRD to expedite cases ahead of Dec. 2",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/business-news/EY-urges-IRD-to-expedite-cases-ahead-of-Dec-2/273-350322",
