    "md5": "9236a73b83e654488f562022109af044",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 1935,
    "chunk_text": "HNB FINANCE opens new Dehiwala branch\n\nHNB FINANCE Managing Director and CEO Chaminda Prabhath ceremonially opens new Dehiwala branch\n\nHNB FINANCE PLC has further expanded its islandwide presence with the opening of its 77th branch in Dehiwala, strengthening access to a comprehensive range of financial services for the customers in the area.\n\nThe new HNB FINANCE Dehiwala branch is located at No. 176, Galle Road, Dehiwala.\n\nThe branch was ceremonially opened under the patronage of HNB FINANCE PLC Managing Director and CEO Chaminda Prabhath and Deputy CEO Maduranga Heenkenda, with the participation of the members of the company\u2019s senior management and invited guests.\n\nThe new branch will provide the customers in Dehiwala and surrounding areas access to HNB FINANCE\u2019s range of financial solutions including gold loans, leasing, fixed deposits and saving facilities.\n\nThe customers will also have access to HNB FINANCE\u2019s specialised gold loan solutions, including Gold Plan and VIP Gold Loan facilities, which have been designed to cater to varying customer requirements. These facilities provide the customers with convenient access to finance together with flexible repayment options.\n\nPrabhath said, \u201cOur strategic objective is to further strengthen HNB FINANCE\u2019s position as a preferred non-bank financial services provider offering a comprehensive range of financial solutions. Through our new Dehiwala branch, we aim to provide the customers in Dehiwala and surrounding areas with greater access to our latest financial solutions together with an enhanced service experience.\u201d\n\n\u201cOur ability to tailor financial solutions to different customer requirements has enabled HNB FINANCE to remain responsive even in a challenging economic environment. We remain committed to delivering service excellence and we believe the customers will experience that same commitment through our new Dehiwala branch,\u201d he added."
  },
