    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/hard-talk/Colombo-Port-City-positive-over-thaw-between-Indian-PM-Modi-and-Chinese-President-at-BRICS-summit-Thulci-Aluwihare-Deputy-Managing-Director-CHEC-Port-City-Colombo/334-350407",
