    "chunk_text": "Customs revenue surpasses Rs. 2 trillion\n\nColombo, Sep. 16 (Daily Mirror) - Sri Lanka Customs has surpassed the Rs. 2 trillion mark in revenue collection, recording a significant milestone in its annual revenue performance.\n\nCustoms announced that the Rs. 2 trillion threshold was crossed yesterday, describing the achievement as a major milestone for the department.\n\nThe latest revenue figure reflects the Customs Department\u2019s contribution to government revenue collection."
