    "description": "EU opens door for Canada to become its first associate member, von der Leyen says",
    "url_metadata": "https://www.dailymirror.lk/international/EU-opens-door-for-Canada-to-become-its-first-associate-member-von-der-Leyen-says/107-350453",
    "lang": "en",
