    "chunk_text": "Two killed, several injured in Mattakkuliya accident\n\nColombo, Sep 16 (Daily MIrror) -Two people were killed and several others injured in a collision involving a car, a three-wheeler and four motorcycles in Mattakkuliya tonight (16).\n\nThe injured were rushed to the Colombo National Hospital for treatment.\n\nPolice are conducting further investigations to determine the cause of the accident."
